---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="FAQ | 1st Capital Locksmith Dover, DE"
  description="Frequently asked questions about 1st Capital Locksmith services in Dover, Delaware."
>

  <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-3">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 flex-wrap">
        <li>
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#A61E22] transition font-medium">Home</a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
          <span class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold">FAQ</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Schema: Breadcrumb -->
  <Fragment set:html={`<script type="application/ld+json">${JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.1stcapitallocksmith.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "FAQ", "item": "https://www.1stcapitallocksmith.com/faq/" }
    ]
  })}</script>`} />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section
    class="relative min-h-[400px] flex items-center text-white py-16"
    style="background-image: url('/images/hero.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"
  >
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/70"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 z-10">
      <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-4">FAQ</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-2xl">
        Find answers to common questions about our locksmith services in Dover and surrounding Delaware areas.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Have Questions? We Have Answers.</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        At 1st Capital Locksmith, we want you to feel confident before calling us. Below you'll find answers to the most common questions we receive from customers in Dover, Kent County, and surrounding Delaware communities. If you don't see your question answered here, don't hesitate to give us a call at <br><a href="tel:3027350050" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold">(302) 735-0050</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- General FAQ -->
  <section class="bg-[#F8F8F5] py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-8 pb-2 border-b border-gray-300">General Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">What areas do you serve?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">We serve Dover, Kent County, and surrounding Delaware communities including Milford, Smyrna, Camden, Harrington, Magnolia, Wyoming, and nearby areas. Contact us to confirm coverage in your location.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Are you a mobile locksmith?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We are a fully mobile locksmith service. We come directly to your home, vehicle, or business with all the tools and equipment needed to complete the job on-site. There is no shop to visit — we bring the service to you.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">How fast can you arrive?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">We dispatch quickly after receiving your call and aim to arrive as fast as possible. Estimated arrival times depend on your location and current service demand. We will give you an estimated time of arrival when you call.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">How much does locksmith service cost?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Pricing varies depending on the service type, complexity, and time of day. We always provide upfront quotes before any work begins so there are no surprise charges. Call us at <a href="tel:3027350050" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold">(302) 735-0050</a> for a quick estimate.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">How do I request service?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">The fastest way to reach us is by calling <a href="tel:3027350050" class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold">(302) 735-0050</a>. You can also fill out our contact form and we will follow up as soon as possible.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Automotive FAQ -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-8 pb-2 border-b border-gray-300">Automotive Locksmith Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you unlock my car if I'm locked out?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We provide car lockout service across Dover and surrounding areas. We use professional non-destructive methods to unlock your vehicle quickly without causing damage.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you replace a lost car key?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We provide on-site car key replacement including standard keys, transponder keys, and key fobs for many makes and models. We can cut and program a new key at your location.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you program a key fob?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We offer key fob programming and remote setup at your location. We sync the fob to your vehicle and test it before leaving to ensure everything works properly.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you fix or replace an ignition?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We handle ignition repair for stuck keys and worn cylinders as well as full ignition replacement for failed ignition systems. Our mobile unit arrives equipped to handle ignition issues on-site.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you extract a broken key from a lock or ignition?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We offer broken key extraction from door locks and ignitions using professional tools designed to remove broken key pieces without damaging the lock or ignition cylinder.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Residential FAQ -->
  <section class="bg-[#F8F8F5] py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-8 pb-2 border-b border-gray-300">Residential Locksmith Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you unlock my house if I'm locked out?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We provide residential lockout service for homeowners and renters. We use non-destructive entry methods whenever possible to get you back inside without damaging your door or lock.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">What is lock rekeying and when should I do it?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Rekeying changes the internal pins of your lock so old keys no longer work. It's a cost-effective security option recommended after moving into a new home, losing a key, or ending a relationship with someone who had access to your property.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you install a new deadbolt?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We install deadbolts and other residential lock hardware to improve your home's security. We can recommend the right hardware for your door and ensure a proper fit and installation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you repair a damaged or jammed lock?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We repair jammed, sticky, and damaged residential locks. Our technicians diagnose the issue and restore smooth lock operation, or recommend a replacement if the lock is beyond repair.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Commercial FAQ -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-8 pb-2 border-b border-gray-300">Commercial Locksmith Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Do you work on commercial properties?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We provide commercial locksmith services for offices, storefronts, warehouses, and other business properties. Services include office lockouts, lock rekeying, panic bar installation, and master key systems.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you rekey our business after a staff change?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. Commercial rekeying is one of the most common services we provide for businesses. After employee turnover or a security concern, rekeying ensures that old keys no longer provide access to your property.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Do you install panic bars?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We install and replace panic bars and exit hardware for commercial properties. Proper panic bar installation is important for building code compliance and occupant safety.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you set up a master key system for our business?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We design and install master key systems that allow different levels of access for different employees. This is ideal for offices, apartment buildings, and multi-unit commercial properties.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you unlock our office if we are locked out?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We provide commercial lockout service for offices, storefronts, and other business properties. We respond quickly to minimize disruption to your business operations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Do you install high-security locks for businesses?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We supply and install high-security commercial locks that offer greater resistance to picking, drilling, and forced entry. We can recommend the right solution based on your property and security needs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Can you help after a break-in at our business?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. After a break-in, we provide emergency board-up assistance, lock repair, and lock replacement to secure your property as quickly as possible and restore access control.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Do you work with property managers and landlords?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. We regularly work with property managers and landlords to rekey units between tenants, repair locks, and handle lockout calls. We offer reliable and professional service to keep your properties secure.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Reviews -->
  <section class="bg-[#F8F8F5] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Customer Reviews</p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mt-3">
          Trusted by Customers Throughout Delaware
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
          <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700">"Fast response and very professional. Got my car unlocked quickly and without damage."</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">Michael R. — Car lockout</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Dover, DE</p>
          <strong>★★★★★</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
          <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700">"Needed a new key fob programmed. Service was quick and pricing was fair."</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">Samantha T. — Key fob programming</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Milford, DE</p>
          <strong>★★★★★</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
          <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700">"Excellent locksmith service. Arrived on time and rekeyed our locks the same day."</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">David H. — Residential rekey</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Smyrna, DE</p>
          <strong>★★★★★</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
          <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700">"Replaced the deadbolt on our storefront and helped with a panic bar install. Great work."</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">Emma L. — Commercial locks</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Camden, DE</p>
          <strong>★★★★★</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
          <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700">"Locked my keys in the house late at night. They arrived fast and got me back inside without damage."</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">Tyler S. — Home lockout</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Harrington, DE</p>
          <strong>★★★★★</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
          <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700">"Great service for our business lock rekey and new access keys. Dependable and professional."</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">Olivia M. — Business rekey</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Dover, DE</p>
          <strong>★★★★★</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-[#1A1F22] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Still Have Questions?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">Contact us directly and we'll be happy to help.</p>
      <a
        href="tel:3027350050"
        class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-8 py-3 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition"
      >
        Call (302) 735-0050
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</MainLayout>